"Lindsy Tambayong\",\"character\":\"Bella\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6414983,\"name\":\"Yuditia Winanda\",\"character\":\"Prince's Bodyguard\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/secAWLheRz257DJqoByh6diWsHd.jpg\"},{\"id\":1379137,\"name\":\"Mario Maulana\",\"character\":\"Rangga\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7PNmdAaEC6CwKH2ZnR0BItZMxXH.jpg\"},{\"id\":1497602,\"name\":\"Sellen Fernandez\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yTPtU049bkmV9Ci0HrE9KnPwXRX.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"PhOR6DIS_Ho\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"MvpYIela7_o\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"prE0lIZOqbk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Only Entry,  No Exit\",\"seasonOverview\":\"The public was shocked by the viral video of Atiqah, a famous model with millions of fans. Not many people know that the Royals Agency is an online prostitution network under the guise of talent management. Can Atiqah rebuild his career?\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uNDE2b3cUOwbyVxpETCVMkJkyoU.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2021-02-10\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Beauty Event\",\"overview\":\"In order to follow in the footsteps of her idol, Ayu, a simple teenager, takes part in a beauty event organized by the Royals Agency. Without Ayu knowing, trouble was waiting for her.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uMSWWdXc33hzPrkYMPM8LVtamjH.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-10\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"New Star\",\"overview\":\"Ayu was crowned as The New Star Of Royals Agency. Popularity slowly lulled her, slowly she forgot his family and friends.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kFfbPp3MonCxsyg2sdrZ6AcfCpI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-17\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Danger\",\"overview\":\"The first job from the Royals Agency makes Ayu flustered. She is faced with a difficult choice that puts himself and his family at risk.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8fVErkhmrvp43GmoxcTyUMNTAxw.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-24\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Pride\",\"overview\":\"Ayu is increasing caught in the vortex of the Royals Agency problem. Everything was at stake, including her pride and honor.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vuAuhbTTYDsOYbUwIfSLAloJPc6.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-03\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Prince & Royals\",\"overview\":\"When Ayu's relationship with Kevin gets closer, Prince and the Royals Agency are trapped again.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dpdBpVpHwCMVO7yflAZJE7jnevO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-10\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Supervision\",\"overview\":\"Atiqah tries to remind Ayu what dangers lurk her.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7bxqWBZDs8IXoyF7gQucL1cWu1A.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-17\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Backfire\",\"overview\":\"Ayu's determination to leave the Royals Agency is getting stronger. The evidence that Atiqah had gathered turned against her.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qkNFcz1rYHSNH6AkL4yOclpsR0n.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-24\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Coming Threats\",\"overview\":\"Atiqah's departure leaves many unresolved questions. Ayu is increasingly aware that a great danger will soon come to her.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ixt4OcuLub0W7WzNbiUNljXgcHt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-31\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Living Evidence\",\"overview\":\"Ayu gets a letter explaining what happened to Atiqah. Ayu believes Atiqah is still alive.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9aZzhA5awxCdJR1w6M4FFFbe4Eb.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-07\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Instruction\",\"overview\":\"Ayu's suspicions about the Maestro figure as the brain behind all Royals Agency businesses are increasing. Slowly clues began to emerge.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sCi8So7QsW2V8IcxLum4Iw9Mszj.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-14\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Maestro\",\"overview\":\"The bright spot regarding the figure of the Maestro is starting to appear. Ayu is sure that with the revelation of the Maestro figure, all the problems that befell her will end.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jYi2nJ9vQLVSlkUEGUPYIs7gkyh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-21\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Friends Under the Blanket\",\"overview\":\"Things are getting complicated for Ayu, Atiqah and Kevin. The figure they had considered a friend turned out to be a ruthless enemy.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cibgx5n0PTEf1Oa3v7gVgPNYDVZ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-28\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Journey of Change\",\"overview\":\"All the scandals that haunt Ayu's life are getting resolved. However, can Ayu forget it all and be happy with her life?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2cBBxQiVihnTm7rd3PW9SmNKJ5d.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-05-05\",\"runtime\":39}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2021-02-10\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}